# Converge counts colors of mana spent (CR 105.1: colorless is not a color). On turn three Bot1 casts it with X = 2: a Sol Ring's
# {C}{C} pays the generic and a Mox Pearl the {W}, so one color is spent and it exiles Bot2's Mother of Runes (mana value 1). A land is
# not a legal target (the refusal, beside the Mother, the positive control), though the Island stays untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Prismatic Ending
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mother of Runes
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mother of Runes.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Prismatic Ending.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island; X: 2)
Bot1.Hand.Prismatic Ending.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mother of Runes; X: 2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Mother of Runes
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Mox Pearl
